OL,3,AAt least 11 injured in shooting at
OL,4,ATurkish high school
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 11 people have been injured in
OL,7,Fa shooting outside a high school in
OL,8,FTurkey after an attacker opened fire
OL,9,Fbefore fleeing the scene.
OL,11,FThe incident happened at the Inci Uzmez
OL,12,FVocational and Technical Anatolian High
OL,13,FSchool in Turkey's western province of
OL,14,FManisa at about 08:00 local time (05:00
OL,15,FGMT) on Tuesday.
OL,17,FThe attacker has since been detained,
OL,18,Faccording to the local governor's
OL,19,Foffice.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
